{"ID":"20240220132604-5gmtxq6","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240220132604-5gmtxq6","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240220132604-5gmtxq6\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312171530-us7yh5k\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312171530-lthvgfs\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312171530-lthvgfs\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:48,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:48\u0026#125;","title":"【苦酒汤】（半夏苦酒汤）","type":"doc","updated":"20240312171530"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240312171530-us7yh5k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171530-us7yh5k","updated":"20240312171530"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第三百二十六条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171530-hu1bq40","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171530-hu1bq40","updated":"20240312171530"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：「少阴病」，咽中伤，生疮，不能语言，声不出者，「苦酒汤」主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171530-pji6tb4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171530-pji6tb4","updated":"20240312171530"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"苦酒就是醋"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。平时可以一瓶醋，放点生半夏在里面，冷藏。平常泡在那边，泡时用醋，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"张仲景那个朝代都没有白醋，都是米醋"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。泡了很久了，放在那边。病人来了，半夏苦酒汤，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"不能吃东西，声音没了"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。拿一个鸡蛋，壳打破壳留一半，蛋黄不要了，用汤匙捞大概两颗生半夏，生半夏已经（用醋）泡开了，跟蛋壳里的蛋清，里面还有一点醋和在一起，和一和，用酒精灯或者蜡烛、打火机在蛋壳下面烧一下，很快，看到起一两个泡泡，马上熄火，大概只能一分熟，拿给病人，喝下去。他什么都吞不下去，但这个能吞的进去。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171530-tdy7lbt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171530-tdy7lbt","updated":"20240312171530"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"最严重的情况摔着什么都吞不下去了，还有巴豆贝母，弄成牙膏黏黏的，用管子吸起来，喷到喉咙里面去。一喷进去打个洞出来，所以不能乱喷，喷到舌头上，舌头打个洞，巴豆腐蚀性很强，所以要对的很准"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。不小心吸进去很痛，像烧的一样，喝杯冷水吐掉就好了，巴豆碰到冷水，当场毒就解掉了。就好像吃硫磺怕中毒，中毒的话全身麻，不能动，吃鸭肉汤当场就解掉了。当医生要能收能放。没办法就喷，打个洞下去，比半夏苦酒汤强十几倍，非常迅速。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171530-o50jyq0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171530-o50jyq0","updated":"20240312171530"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"半夏苦酒汤不要泡白醋泡黑醋力量比较强。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312171530-areumas","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171530-areumas","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312171530"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"苦酒汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312171530-mb9mv6s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171530-mb9mv6s","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312171530"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"半夏洗破，如枣核，大十四枚。鸡子十枚，去黄，内上苦酒，着鸡子壳中。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312171530-lthvgfs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171530-lthvgfs","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312171530"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右二味，纳半夏，着苦酒中，以鸡子破，置刀环中，安火上，令三沸，去滓，少少含咽之，不差，更作三剂。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]}]}